<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 3</h3>For Holy Paladins, there's very little to use <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> for, so generally hanging on to them until you're ready to drop your T8 and buy a 245 T9 helm with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> is the best bet. The only non-tier item that is worth purchasing is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48724/talisman-of-resurgence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Talisman of Resurgence</span></a>, which is a strong option for any fights where you won't require much sustain but do want an extra burst of healing in certain phases.<br/>
<br/>Under no circumstances should you purchase ANY of the 232 Tier 9 set, as it's strictly worse in every way than Tier 8 and overall a waste of emblems. Unfortunately, this holds true with most of the other items as well. <b>Everything listed after #2 on this list is only listed as a catchup option for new Holy Paladins who do not have any Tier 8/<wbr/>ANY other options</b>; they are fairly weak purchases that are easily replaced with many better options.<br/>
