<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 3</h3>
<i>Tier slot - If using the Tank EHP build, you will wear the T8 item. If using the Standard build, use the highest listed non-T8 item here, or highest item level item in your possession.</i>
<br/>
<br/>Since there are quite a few potential ilvl upgrades, only a few of the easiest to acquire options will be listed. Keep in mind that due to the extreme competition regarding <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47557/regalia-of-the-grand-conqueror">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Grand Conqueror</span></a>, you will generally have to settle for one of the 245 helms for a while.<br/>
<br/>For the standard build, this is your biggest stat difference between a 258 helm and the next best option, so it should be the first slot you use a Regalia for, if you have the option.<br/>
<br/>
