<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 3</h3>Here comes by far the most contested item in the tier, the 272 cloak which is expansion-BiS for several classes. Due to the extreme requirements of both the 272 and 258 Tribute cloaks, it's likely that extremely few players will ever get their hands on these, let alone as a healer.<br/>
<br/>Unfortunately, most of the other cloaks aren't very well itemized for Holy Paladin, so it's more than reasonable to just stick to your Tier 8 cloak for most of the tier.<br/>
<br/>Due to the item level alone, several cloaks with hit and spirit are upgrades from the 252 cloak; however, considering that neither of these stats benefit Holy Paladins at all but do benefit other members of your raid, they are omitted.<br/>
