<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 3</h3>There are a few more ring options in T9, and the best possible ring has MP5, making it mostly healer-only. The Algalon quest rings, however, continue to be very good and possibly somewhat contested depending on how many times your raid has cleared the boss.<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind that you cannot equip both the normal and heroic versions of any of the Trial of the Crusader rings, as they are Unique-Equipped.<br/>
<br/>It's worth noting while there are some spirit options that are high EP, they are purposefully omitted from the list as they're BiS or otherwise extremely good for actual spirit casters but only okay for Holy Paladin.<br/>
