<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 3</h3>The trinket situation continues to stay very similar to Phase 2, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46051/meteorite-crystal">
