<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="librams-for-holy-paladin-healer-phase-3">Librams for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 3</h4>There is only one libram that's even remotely worth considering, and it's <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40705/libram-of-renewal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_libramofgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of Renewal</span></a>. This libram is so powerful it is effectively BiS for the whole expansion. With an extremely anemic 25 CPM, it's already at 236 MP5; at 40 CPM, it goes up to 377 MP5. Get it ASAP and enjoy a BiS item forever.<br/>
<br/>Despite there being a few fights in Phase 3 that don't tax your mana, there realistically just isn't a competitor to this slot.<div class="pad"></div>
